Are you affiliated with Gifty? Then make yourself comfortable and use the Gifty plugin. Place the order module at the touch of a button or embed it on any page and sell giftcards on your website without difficulty.

== Description ==

The [Gifty](https://gifty.nl) plugin enables you to add the Gifty order module to your WordPress website quickly and with ease.

# Integration options
This are the available integration options:
* Add the order module icon to every page
* Embed the order module on any page or blog post
* Add a menu item to toggle the order module on any page

# Registration and Installation
To be able to use this plugin you need the unique integration code that is provided in your [dashboard](https://dashboard.gifty.nl/settings/module/placement). To get started you can register on [gifty.nl](https://gifty.nl).

# Pricing
You can start using Gifty for free. Please check out our [pricing](https://gifty.nl/prijzen) page for subscription options.

# Privacy Policy and Terms and Conditions
We respect your privacy and only process your personal data for the purpose for which you have provided them. To read more on this subject please check out our [Privacy Policy](https://gifty.nl/privacy-verklaring). Our global [Terms and Conditions](https://gifty.nl/algemene-voorwaarden) apply on this plugin.

